 "brief": "Settlers attacked the Abu al-Hamra area in Beita, south of Nablus, on Friday morning, Shehab Wire reported. The assailants targeted an industrial facility and a structure belonging to resident Samer Abu Mazen, opening fire with live ammunition, according to local sources.\n\nThe incident is the latest in a pattern of settler violence in the area, which has seen repeated clashes between Palestinian residents and Israeli settlers.",
